docs {
  # Penelitian (Usulan Penelitian) API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen usulan penelitian.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/penelitian`

  ## Alias URL (Compatibility)
  `/api/usulan-penelitian`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | /landing | ❌ | Public | Konten landing penelitian |
  | GET | / | ✅ | All | List usulan penelitian user |
  | GET | /options | ✅ | All | Dropdown options untuk form |
  | GET | /detail | ✅ | All | Detail usulan penelitian |
  | GET | /by-prodi | ✅ | Koordinator | List usulan berdasarkan prodi |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Buat usulan penelitian |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Update usulan (Draft only) |
  | POST | /:id/submit | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Submit usulan |
  | POST | /:id/forward | ✅ | Koordinator | Forward usulan + lampiran |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Hapus usulan (Draft only) |
  | POST | /search | ✅ | All | Cari usulan penelitian |
  
  ## Status Usulan
  - `Draft` - Belum disubmit
  - `Pending` - Menunggu review
  - `Disetujui` - Approved
  - `Ditolak` - Rejected
  - `Revisi` - Perlu revisi
}
